{{High Risk|Template:Utaite|nocat = 1|pagetype = Main}}
This infobox is designed for content creators' profiles, especially Utaite. It provides a comprehensive summary of their profile, social media presence, and key activities.

==Syntax==
Below is a list of commonly used parameters. For a complete list, please refer to the TemplateData section.
<br/>

{{T|Utaite|block=1
|v1=pagename           =
|v2=image              =
|v3=officialillustrator=
|v4=officialjapname    =
|v5=officialromajiname =
|v6=officialengname    =
