}}

==Examples==
===Basic Usage===
This example shows a minimal setup with only the essential information.

{{T|Utaite|block=1|_Y_=1
|p1=pagename      = Utaite Name
|p2=image         = Template doc.png
|p3=gender        = Female
|p4=fanname       = Fan Name
|p5=status        = {{Active}}
|p6=affiliation   = [[Affiliated Group]]
|p7=YTchannel     = UCxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
|p8=Twitter       = username
}}

